{"review_id": "483614530", "app_id": "393159800", "app_name": "Way of Life - Habit Tracker", "country": "il", "country_name": "Israel", "rating": 5, "title": "Top notch lifestyle app!", "body": "I have been working with several apps and was quite satisfied with my last app for habit management, except it was a little slow at times.\n\nLooking for something better I&#39;ve found this app and it completely blew my mind. So fast, so efficient and easy to use, and best of all, serves me like no other for both daily tracking and trend reviews.\n\nEvery feature, every interface, is well thought out and polished to perfection. 5 stars. You gotta get this one.", "author": "Sp00nk", "date": "2011-11-17T16:53:57Z", "vote_count": 0, "vote_sum": 0, "is_edited": false}
{"review_id": "480618894", "app_id": "393159800", "app_name": "Way of Life - Habit Tracker", "country": "il", "country_name": "Israel", "rating": 5, "title": "Best design", "body": "Like this app very much, use it daily. The Trend screen usability is great!\n\nI would suggest to add ability to create items reoccurring not daily. On the Journal screen mark whether this particular item needs input today and on the Trend screen take this into account. \n\nAnother suggestion is connecting items to goals. \n\nThank you", "author": "jgutin", "date": "2011-11-10T03:51:06Z", "vote_count": 0, "vote_sum": 0, "is_edited": false}
